TITLE Pyrite oxidation equilibrium, 1 kg pure water, 25C, log PO2=-0.7, allow 0.1 mol pyrite; allow goethite, gypsum
SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    -water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    O2(g)   -0.7  10
    Pyrite  0     0.1
    Goethite 0    0
    Gypsum   0    0
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file pyrite_ox.sel
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings Alkalinity_eq
    10 PUNCH ALK
END
